Service/GetItems/v1/","context":{"app_id":4487060,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-4487060-1847286114036561","game_id":"steam-4487060","kind":"announcement","title":"All you need to know for the release ⚔️","summary":"Hey Vikings! We’re less than a week until the Early Access Release on October 27, and while you’re enjoying our current Demo at the Steam Next Fest, we compiled everything you might want to know before the launch!{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46084307/e2a34ea1e51891fc334f32114a880f6741fee404.png Available at Launch - The Clan of the Bear Borgild and the Clan of the Bear will be available at Early Access launch. Working alongside Kaija the Armored Bear, Borgild and her clan focus on strong defence and tough","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-23T14:09:11Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114036561","verified_at":"2026-10-23T18:34:48Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4487060-1847286114028033","game_id":"steam-4487060","kind":"update","title":"Next Fest Hotfix 1 - 0.78.33d","summary":"Hello Northguardians! Small hotfix addressing a serious bug causing people to be unable to play the game if their ELO was too high. (And we snuck it some balance changes 👀).Balance ChangesScout CampProduce 2 → 1 Krown for each empty colonized tile.Hall of SkaldsAttack speed 0.7 → 0.55.Improvements & FixesGetting > 580 Ranked ELO broke our badge system, and soft locked players. You guys are crazy to reach that in 3 days.You could also get soft locked in the tutorial if you bought 2 villagers inst","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-21T08:35:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1847286114028033","verified_at":"2026-10-21T12:21:10Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4487060-1846651706690155","game_id":"steam-4487060","kind":"announcement","title":"Hour of the Wolf - 0.78.27d","summary":"Hello Northguardians! We’re thrilled to welcome the Clan of the Wolf to Northgard Battlegrounds!Along with the Clan of the Wolf this update also includes a balance pass to address the top performing structures. The goal was to bring the top strategy back down a bit after the last balance pass. Health, TOWERS and Thorns were a very strong playstyle, so we’ve adjusted all the important pieces down now.The cleave changes from last patch appear to have made high rarity MYSTICAL units viable again, b","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T13:11:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690155","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4487060-1846651706690131","game_id":"steam-4487060","kind":"update","title":"Clan of the Wolf Demo Update","summary":"Hey Vikings! We're part of the Steam Next Fest with Northgard Battlegrounds Demo! To celebrate, we've also updated the game to add one new clan to the roster: Egil & The Clan of the Wolf You can already try the demo and learn the meta with over 50 structures, a hundred Fate Cards and a ranked Ladder dedicated to the Demo! {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46084307/271bb24fc0c58af76e6cbd1a4bb35e05d139d2e5.jpg Clan of the Wolf This update unlock the Clan of the wolf and its warchief, Egil. This clan allow a more","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T13:07:07Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690131","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4487060-1846651706677928","game_id":"steam-4487060","kind":"update","title":"An Update On Recent Feedback & Demo Patches","summary":"Hi Northgardians, First of all, thank you to everyone who has played the demo over the last week. The overall reception and support have been amazing, and seeing so many of you jump into the game has been incredible after two years of development. We have received a lot of great feedback already, and we want you to know that we are listening closely and doing everything we can to continuously improve the game experience for everyone. Here is a quick look at what we are currently working on and i","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T14:25:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706677928","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4487060-1846651706673994","game_id":"steam-4487060","kind":"update","title":"Matchmaking Patch - 0.78.5d","summary":"Hello Northgardians!FeaturesFree Play matchmaking is… changed. Let us know what you think.You can now lose one more time, before you lose a run (both Ranked and Free Play).","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T11:23:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706673994","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4487060-1846018067941079","game_id":"steam-4487060","kind":"update","title":"Balance Patch - Build 0.77.111d","summary":"Balance Patch - Build 0.77.111d12/10/2026 Hello Northguardians! This is a quick balance patch for the demo, attempting to address some pain points, boosting weak structures, nerfing strong structures (hopefully more boosts than nerfs) and trying to improve MYSTICAL units so lategame isn’t entirely dominated by Kobold and Einherjar spam.One part of that is changing Cleave to have a larger radius and share more damage, meaning that lategame units with lots of cleave might get the chance to chew th","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-12T14:12:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067941079","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4487060-1846018067933563","game_id":"steam-4487060","kind":"announcement","title":"A few numbers from the demo ⚔️","summary":"Hey everyone! It's only been a few days since the demo was released, but we've already received some great feedback from your current playtime. We wanted to share some of the impressive numbers you've achieved as a community! Over 10k+ players since this Tuesday Thank you all for being a part of this journey {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46084307/a3a0eb40136951c317341d20fcdd0a8caa15cc38.png Almost 400k+ battles already fought Wolves, Jotun, Warchiefs: everyone took action in the big battlegrounds! {STEAM_C","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-09T14:50:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067933563","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4487060-1846018067928715","game_id":"steam-4487060","kind":"update","title":"Minor Patch Demo - 0.77.100d","summary":"Minor Patch Demo - 0.77.100d07/10/2026 Hello Vikings! First little patch from us addressing some of the initial technical issues.Improvements & FixesFixed issue, were low frame rates or lag spikes could cause one click to be registered as two (and thus preventing placing a building as soon as you tried to pick it up)This could in some cases also cause the “next” button to freeze up, preventing the player from going to the next phaseUpdated Survey linksAdded fallbacks to resolutions, in case some","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T07:45:19Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067928715","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4487060-1845383656396555","game_id":"steam-4487060","kind":"announcement","title":"Northgard Battlegrounds Demo is out now!","summary":"Our demo is available now on Steam! Whether you are a long time warchief, or a freshly arrived viking, we are excited for you to experience our game and discover the clans of the Raven and Stag. Develop your settlement and gather all the forces you can muster thanks to strategic placements, blessings of the Gods, and a well prepared warband. {STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/46084307/ee79ef23da914793dca467a675c32eee3e3c5a13.jpg Master new strategies with the arrival of the Clan of the wolf, joining the demo on","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T14:06:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656396555","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4487060-1845383656378699","game_id":"steam-4487060","kind":"announcement","title":"Northgard Battlegrounds releases on October 27 ⚔️","summary":"Greetings, Warchiefs! We are pleased to announce that Northgard Battlegrounds is releasing into Early Access on October 27! This release will come after the Demo on October 6 and the Steam Next Fest!Northgard Battlegrounds releases in Early Access at the end of October, which means it’s now or never to learn more about the mechanics of our game! Join Game Designer John, in our new gameplay overview, for a deeper look at the clans, Norse gods and strategies that will shape your path to victory. D","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T18:59:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656378699","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4487060-1838407329256143","game_id":"steam-4487060","kind":"announcement","title":"Thank You for Playing the Northgard Battlegrounds Open Beta!","summary":"Thank You for Playing the Northgard Battlegrounds Open Beta!Vikings,The Northgard Battlegrounds Open Beta has now come to an end! We hope, you enjoy the extra day of Open Beta!From July 9 to July 16, this was the first time we opened the gates of the Battlegrounds to everyone eager to discover our upcoming auto-battler.The main objective of this Open Beta was to stress-test the stability of the build while gathering your first impressions of the game. Thousands of strategies were tested, countle","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-16T09:33:28Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1838407329256143","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4487060-1836506165582964","game_id":"steam-4487060","kind":"announcement","title":"Northgard Battlegrounds Open Beta Now Available!","summary":"Northgard Battlegrounds Open Beta Available Now!Vikings!The Northgard: Battlegrounds Open Beta is now available for everyone until July 15!Jump into the action and discover a new way to experience the world of Northgard. To help you get started, the dev team has prepared a Gameplay Overview video explaining the core mechanics and everything you need to know before your first battles:Open Beta Content Reminder:Raven Clan and Stag ClanOver 50 different structures100+ Fate Cards3 Patrons granting p","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-09T10:23:40Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165582964","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4487060-1836506165576003","game_id":"steam-4487060","kind":"announcement","title":"Don't miss our stream this wednesday!","summary":"Join us live this Wednesday at 4.30pm to get all your questions answered before the beta starts the following day! Our official twitch channel If you can't make it here, or if you'd like to make sure that we answer your question, please fill in this form so that we can discuss it in advance! Ask us a question! See you there Vikings! - The Northgard Battleground team","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-06T13:53:31Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165576003","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4487060-1836506165568083","game_id":"steam-4487060","kind":"announcement","title":"Watch Our New Gameplay Overview!","summary":"Watch the new Deep Dive into our game’s mechanics and get ready for Northgard Battlegrounds to begin an Open Beta phase next week at the start of Tacticon!Gameplay Overview with the devsIn this video, John from Funday Games takes an in-depth look at Northgard Battlegrounds. He breaks down the core mechanics, demonstrating how clans, settlement building, fate cards, and asynchronous PvP works together to make every playthrough feel unique and thrilling. Open Beta next weekYou won’t have to wait m","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-07-02T14:00:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1836506165568083","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4487060-1830163047258447","game_id":"steam-4487060","kind":"announcement","title":"Revealing Northgard Battlegrounds","summary":"Hello Vikings! Time to share Northgard Battlegrounds, our new game setup in the mystical lands of Northgard. The game is made by Funday Games (the devs behind Deep Rock Galactic: Survivor!) and is copublished with Shiro Unlimited. We’re making a city-building auto-battler set in the Viking world of Northgard, where every building you place shapes your clan’s fate. Develop your village, claim the Gods’ blessings, and send your warband into battle against rival players! Every move counts—only one ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-16T19:45:47Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830163047258447","verified_at":"2026-10-20T14:28:31Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4487060":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:33:13Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T02:33:12Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4487060":"2026-10-26T02:33:13Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4487060":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:33:12Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:33:12Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5090100":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T02:33:13Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T02:33:13Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4487060","app_id":4487060,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:37Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1